# {{context|legal|lang=en}} A [[document]], made by a person when still [[legally]] [[fit]] to do so, expressing his [[desire]] to be allowed to [[die]] instead of being kept [[alive]] by [[artificial]] [[mean]]s, in the event of being severely [[disabled]] or suffering from a [[terminal]] [[illness]].

